<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-13T09:47:58.204Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:47:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant attacks continue in northwest Pakistan, where ten police officers and 18 fighters were killed in a recent assault. In Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, security forces killed 74 terrorists during operations, while a separate attack on a Mastung post resulted in three terrorists killed and two civilians dead. Iranian forces claim to have destroyed a US radar site in Bahrain, and the IRGC says it destroyed the same radar after the attack on southern Iran. The conflict still accounts for 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/13/iran-says-it-struck-us-radar-site-in-bahrain?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/irgc-says-it-destroyed-us-radar-in-bahrain-after-attack-on-southern-iran&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1rQ1Qwc3FIZGlDYkNKTGVIaktRSGVPaFlQOHdHellCNW50eXk3VGEzUXhUdnM1ejM2dW5jemNSZlk2MDJDeDNkeA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBYZXhVMVhHeE1OV3BZLVB2ZjcwMW5DNHg0di03UG80MlNoUXEydlQzaVZDTm9oME9LejVXUnZ1T21pTVZRTElncw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQdVV2UVNIbUR6RmluYTNfeGNyenZNTlB3cUhTQ0N5UktidTh6VWhuSXJJT0NmTHo3UXJaenppclRJZ0xJLUZfemo3SGI0b0xETVhjTUpMdV9adjBOU0VzS3VfNTRDYU1CRlFpMkpSV3FIcm40YTUxUXN3cTZCTk1GWkl2TmVDX3NSaG1iVWkzMkk2MHZsMWU0WVVxWFBZYTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
